  - m_Id: 7913462628868099
    m_Localized: Once the music starts, processed items will appear on the conveyor
      belt. Press the matching button when the item passes through the packing zone,
      or it counts as a failure. Defective items must be discarded, or the machine
      will jam and block other items from being processed.
